00:19:06,076 --> 00:19:07,505
You kept looking up.

531
00:19:07,506 --> 00:19:08,806
- Exactly.
- With empty eyes.

532
00:19:09,276 --> 00:19:10,605
He was counting the numbers.

533
00:19:10,606 --> 00:19:12,116
Born in 2004?

534
00:19:13,046 --> 00:19:15,386
I kept calculating while looking up.

535
00:19:15,786 --> 00:19:17,145
Yun So really has a melancholic vibe.

536
00:19:17,146 --> 00:19:18,855
(Feeling embarrassed)

537
00:19:18,856 --> 00:19:20,985
He always looks at the ceiling when he's thinking.

538
00:19:20,986 --> 00:19:22,155
That's right.

539
00:19:22,156 --> 00:19:24,555
You'd have guessed her age back then.

540
00:19:24,556 --> 00:19:26,525
Did you still like her the same way?

541
00:19:26,526 --> 00:19:29,465
Right. I could get an idea...

542
00:19:29,466 --> 00:19:31,366
- from that picture.
- Right.

543
00:19:31,496 --> 00:19:33,936
But it didn't matter to me.

544
00:19:33,996 --> 00:19:35,735
- That was the first day, right?
- Right.

545
00:19:35,736 --> 00:19:37,705
On the first day, you saw her, and...

546
00:19:37,706 --> 00:19:40,676
I think it was love at first sight.

547
00:19:41,206 --> 00:19:42,346
All right.

548
00:19:42,806 --> 00:19:45,416
(Ju Hee and Yun So with an age gap of 11 years)

549
00:19:45,576 --> 00:19:46,875
(Ju Hee and Yun So's first date)

550
00:19:46,876 --> 00:19:50,186
Ju Hee was so pretty that day.

551
00:19:51,516 --> 00:19:52,685
This place looks really nice.

552
00:19:52,686 --> 00:19:53,956
- Right.
- Isn't it?

553
00:19:55,156 --> 00:19:57,086
(Staring)

554
00:19:58,556 --> 00:20:01,096
I looked at her from the side. She was beautiful.

555
00:20:02,426 --> 00:20:03,896
- She looks pretty.
- I felt that...

556
00:20:05,266 --> 00:20:08,436
for the first time in a while. It felt new.

557
00:20:09,906 --> 00:20:11,206
You can see the love in his eyes.

558
00:20:12,276 --> 00:20:13,906
I should have stuck with him starting from that time.

559
00:20:14,236 --> 00:20:15,376
That's right.

560
00:20:17,646 --> 00:20:19,545
- I thought about Ju Hee a lot.
- Right.

561
00:20:19,546 --> 00:20:22,485
(I thought about Ju Hee a lot during the date.)

562
00:20:22,486 --> 00:20:23,545
That's pure love.

563
00:20:23,546 --> 00:20:25,185
What do you like about Ju Hee?

564
00:20:25,186 --> 00:20:26,486
I've started to get a bit curious.

565
00:20:28,726 --> 00:20:30,126
I heard him talk all day.

566
00:20:32,026 --> 00:20:33,826
I think I know Ju Hee well now.

567
00:20:36,096 --> 00:20:37,126
I'm sorry.

568
00:20:37,966 --> 00:20:40,196
She's just...

569
00:20:40,836 --> 00:20:44,035
I think the best word to describe her is a fairy.

570
00:20:44,036 --> 00:20:45,236
(Feeling embarrassed)

571
00:20:46,936 --> 00:20:49,105
I also think this part of Ju Hee is amazing.

572
00:20:49,106 --> 00:20:50,176
What part?

573
00:20:51,046 --> 00:20:53,545
I publicly said...

574
00:20:53,546 --> 00:20:55,046
that I like her.

575
00:20:55,346 --> 00:20:57,315
But even after that,

576
00:20:57,316 --> 00:21:00,316
she still approaches people who she's interested in.

577
00:21:00,756 --> 00:21:02,985
I think that also requires a lot of courage.

578
00:21:02,986 --> 00:21:03,986
Yes, that's not easy to do.

579
00:21:03,987 --> 00:21:05,796
I really like that she's true to herself.

580
00:21:07,726 --> 00:21:09,895
I'm upset. I'm hurt too.

581
00:21:09,896 --> 00:21:11,126
- But...
- That's cute.

582
00:21:11,526 --> 00:21:13,195
- I think that's...
- That's cute.

583
00:21:13,196 --> 00:21:15,136
her strength and charm.

584
00:21:15,606 --> 00:21:17,106
He's head over heels for her.

585
00:21:18,506 --> 00:21:20,236
Does she still seem like a fairy to you?

586
00:21:20,976 --> 00:21:22,046
A fairy?

587
00:21:22,376 --> 00:21:25,916
She looks better every time I see her.

588
00:21:26,416 --> 00:21:28,785
She dyed her hair recently...

589
00:21:28,786 --> 00:21:30,116
and became so pretty.

590
00:21:30,846 --> 00:21:32,155
- This is like a drama.
- Seriously.

591
00:21:32,156 --> 00:21:33,616
(My roommate hasn't changed.)

592
00:21:34,516 --> 00:21:36,255
- Learn from him.
- You haven't changed.

593
00:21:36,256 --> 00:21:37,626
Why are you scolding me?

594
00:21:38,556 --> 00:21:40,055
I saw his eyes. He's serious.

595
00:21:40,056 --> 00:21:41,825
- I'm serious.
- He's serious.

596
00:21:41,826 --> 00:21:43,966
- He means it.
- I tell her every day.

597
00:21:44,266 --> 00:21:47,066
How do you feel when you hear that you're like a fairy?

598
00:21:47,596 --> 00:21:48,836
It feels nice.

599
00:21:50,306 --> 00:21:52,905
- It's nice.
- Nice. I'm glad you two met.

600
00:21:52,906 --> 00:21:54,206
(I like it too.)

601
00:21:54,676 --> 00:21:55,875
I really can't make a guess.

602
00:21:55,876 --> 00:21:57,375
(The age reveal day, when reality could become an issue)

603
00:21:57,376 --> 00:21:58,446
I'll say 2000.

604
00:21:58,976 --> 00:22:00,076
I was born in...

605
00:22:01,246 --> 00:22:03,545
two thousand...

606
00:22:03,546 --> 00:22:04,846
- Two thousand?
- Two thousand?

607
00:22:05,386 --> 00:22:06,485
Her eyes became so big.

608
00:22:06,486 --> 00:22:07,715
three.

609
00:22:07,716 --> 00:22:09,225
(Born in 2003, 24 years old)

610
00:22:09,226 --> 00:22:10,355
three.

611
00:22:10,356 --> 00:22:11,786
It looks like she really had no clue.

612
00:22:12,656 --> 00:22:13,995
You were the youngest?

613
00:22:13,996 --> 00:22:15,196
He's 24 years old.

614
00:22:15,696 --> 00:22:18,495
I was quite flustered...

615
00:22:18,496 --> 00:22:20,036
when I heard his age.

616
00:22:21,436 --> 00:22:23,135
Since I want to meet someone...

617
00:22:23,136 --> 00:22:25,505
who I can build a future with,

618
00:22:25,506 --> 00:22:28,035
profession and age matter quite a lot.

619
00:22:28,036 --> 00:22:29,246
You can't ignore those.

620
00:22:30,946 --> 00:22:32,816
You're all so young.

621
00:22:33,416 --> 00:22:35,415
- The average suddenly dropped.
- It suddenly dropped.

622
00:22:35,416 --> 00:22:36,946
Well,

623
00:22:37,146 --> 00:22:39,155
- we have an age gap, - Yes.

624
00:22:39,156 --> 00:22:40,255
and it's not necessarily a burden,

625
00:22:40,256 --> 00:22:43,226
but I think there are things you wouldn't have thought about.

626
00:22:43,686 --> 00:22:44,986
So I can't bring them up.

627
00:22:48,256 --> 00:22:49,625
So I'd rather you...

628
00:22:49,626 --> 00:22:51,626
be more curious about me.

629
00:22:53,666 --> 00:22:55,906
It's also hard...

630
00:22:56,766 --> 00:22:57,865
- Why?
- for me to talk to you because...

631
00:22:57,866 --> 00:22:58,976
Yes?

632
00:22:59,406 --> 00:23:01,775
It feels like...

633
00:23:01,776 --> 00:23:03,806
I'm more focused on dating,

634
00:23:03,976 --> 00:23:05,345
- and you...
- Right.

635
00:23:05,346 --> 00:23:07,145
seem more focused...

636
00:23:07,146 --> 00:23:09,545
on getting married.

637
00:23:09,546 --> 00:23:10,546
- That's not entirely wrong.
- Right.

638
00:23:10,547 --> 00:23:11,616
You're half right.

639
00:23:11,746 --> 00:23:13,055
I haven't thought about that...

640
00:23:13,056 --> 00:23:15,686
so seriously yet.

641
00:23:16,026 --> 00:23:17,685
I thought so too.

642
00:23:17,686 --> 00:23:19,525
That's why I can't ask you about it.

643
00:23:19,526 --> 00:23:22,196
That's why I'm also scared to ask you things.

644
00:23:23,366 --> 00:23:26,796
(Their focus about dating and marriage is different.)

645
00:23:26,936 --> 00:23:29,736
It can't be helped because you're in different age groups.

646
00:23:29,906 --> 00:23:31,806
Your focus would be different.

647
00:23:32,736 --> 00:23:35,775
Like Ju Hee said, when you talked about marriage...

648
00:23:35,776 --> 00:23:38,075
Actually, we also know...

649
00:23:38,076 --> 00:23:39,375
that getting married is difficult.

650
00:23:39,376 --> 00:23:42,345
But if you had just said,

651
00:23:42,346 --> 00:23:44,185
"I'll prepare for it well, Ju Hee,"

652
00:23:44,186 --> 00:23:45,785
it would have been...

653
00:23:45,786 --> 00:23:46,816
a little...

654
00:23:47,186 --> 00:23:50,355
easier for Ju Hee to decide quickly.

655
00:23:50,356 --> 00:23:52,025
To speak from Yun So's perspective...

656
00:23:52,026 --> 00:23:54,626
I've been his age before too.

657
00:23:54,826 --> 00:23:56,426
If I think about how I was at that age,

658
00:23:56,726 --> 00:23:58,866
I can understand what he said.

659
00:23:59,236 --> 00:24:01,335
At his age, it's only natural...

660
00:24:01,336 --> 00:24:02,706
that dating is his main focus.

661
00:24:02,936 --> 00:24:05,265
I was telling him...

662
00:24:05,266 --> 00:24:06,975
- the situation I was in.
- Right.

663
00:24:06,976 --> 00:24:09,675
I wasn't suggesting us to do anything.

664
00:24:09,676 --> 00:24:10,676
- Right.
- Right.

665
00:24:10,677 --> 00:24:12,445
I said that to explain my situation...

666
00:24:12,446 --> 00:24:14,276
so he could take it...

667
00:24:14,816 --> 00:24:18,045
more seriously.

668
00:24:18,046 --> 00:24:19,255
But that...

669
00:24:19,256 --> 00:24:20,455
(I know.)

670
00:24:20,456 --> 00:24:24,285
Of course, it could feel like a burden to him.

671
00:24:24,286 --> 00:24:27,655
He may not have wanted to say empty words.

672
00:24:27,656 --> 00:24:30,226
I think that's the right way to put it.

673
00:24:30,926 --> 00:24:34,296
In the end, if I was to continue this relationship,

674
00:24:34,766 --> 00:24:37,766
there were some things I had to take care of.

675
00:24:38,236 --> 00:24:39,575
I didn't want to say that...

676
00:24:39,576 --> 00:24:40,935
- so lightly.
- Right.

677
00:24:40,936 --> 00:24:42,845
I think that's why I gave an unrelated answer.

678
00:24:42,846 --> 00:24:44,546
I was flustered as well.

679
00:24:45,106 --> 00:24:47,216
- I think that's understandable.
- Right.

680
00:24:47,376 --> 00:24:50,286
How is it now? Have you figured things out?

681
00:24:50,916 --> 00:24:53,486
We're talking about so many things.

682
00:24:53,816 --> 00:24:57,756
For now, we're just focusing on each other.

683
00:24:58,256 --> 00:25:00,525
I think she was being considerate by suggesting...

684
00:25:00,526 --> 00:25:02,696
that we focus on the present rather than the future.

685
00:25:04,126 --> 00:25:08,335
(7 days later, the day of the final decision)

686
00:25:08,336 --> 00:25:09,535
You met her at the Han River.

687
00:25:09,536 --> 00:25:11,836
(Yun So arrived at the meeting place first.)

688
00:25:12,036 --> 00:25:15,776
(The two had the most realistic concerns.)

689
00:25:20,776 --> 00:25:21,846
What?

690
00:25:24,616 --> 00:25:25,986
How pretty.

691
00:25:28,716 --> 00:25:29,885
(He fell for her again.)

692
00:25:29,886 --> 00:25:30,986
He fell in love again.

693
00:25:31,826 --> 00:25:32,956
How many times will you fall for her?

694
00:25:34,756 --> 00:25:36,366
She looks beautiful.

695
00:25:37,596 --> 00:25:39,896
- Mine's so small.
- That's right.

696
00:25:40,496 --> 00:25:42,465
I asked them to make it small...

697
00:25:42,466 --> 00:25:43,966
Right.

698
00:25:44,236 --> 00:25:45,466
Even his flowers are younger.

699
00:25:47,506 --> 00:25:48,946
- The size?
- The size.

700
00:25:49,476 --> 00:25:50,776
I thought it was my graduation.

701
00:25:52,276 --> 00:25:53,316
That's cute.

702
00:25:54,146 --> 00:25:56,045
I have a question.

703
00:25:56,046 --> 00:25:57,116
What is it?

704
00:25:57,916 --> 00:25:59,615
Did you tell your parents?

705
00:25:59,616 --> 00:26:01,885
I told them right away.

706
00:26:01,886 --> 00:26:03,285
You told them right away?

707
00:26:03,286 --> 00:26:05,255
- Yes.
- I was so worried about that.

708
00:26:05,256 --> 00:26:06,855
Right. I get why.

709
00:26:06,856 --> 00:26:08,126
(She was worried how his parents would react.)

710
00:26:08,326 --> 00:26:10,226
Actually, it was just...

711
00:26:10,796 --> 00:26:12,095
as I expected.

712
00:26:12,096 --> 00:26:13,496
"We respect your decision."

713
00:26:14,366 --> 00:26:17,206
"We don't mind whether she's 11 years or 20 years older."

714
00:26:18,306 --> 00:26:19,376
Twenty years?

715
00:26:20,876 --> 00:26:23,746
My parents said they respect my decision.

716
00:26:25,546 --> 00:26:26,746
Did you tell your parents?

717
00:26:29,086 --> 00:26:30,745
To some extent...

718
00:26:30,746 --> 00:26:31,815
(Hesitating)

719
00:26:31,816 --> 00:26:34,156
- You were careful.
- I told them to some extent.

720
00:26:36,456 --> 00:26:39,656
I feel like you'd feel more burdened.

721
00:26:42,366 --> 00:26:43,726
The age...

722
00:26:44,126 --> 00:26:46,136
I'm confident I can handle it.

723
00:26:46,666 --> 00:26:50,166
I think I could learn a lot from you regarding this.

724
00:26:51,366 --> 00:26:53,635
I'm excited about our future together.

725
00:26:53,636 --> 00:26:55,506
(Looking into her eyes)

726
00:26:56,246 --> 00:26:58,006
I told my mom.

727
00:26:59,246 --> 00:27:02,016
But I couldn't tell my dad.

728
00:27:02,246 --> 00:27:04,686
Dad got to know now.

729
00:27:05,346 --> 00:27:06,686
(She's shocked.)

730
00:27:07,816 --> 00:27:08,986
What did your mom say?

731
00:27:09,526 --> 00:27:11,856
Mom...

732
00:27:13,056 --> 00:27:16,265
is worried. She's still worried.

733
00:27:16,266 --> 00:27:17,266
Right.

734
00:27:17,267 --> 00:27:19,365
Dad just found out a few days ago.

735
00:27:19,366 --> 00:27:20,395
The day before yesterday.

736
00:27:20,396 --> 00:27:21,396
(Feeling surprised)

737
00:27:21,397 --> 00:27:22,606
Are you okay, Yun So?

738
00:27:23,266 --> 00:27:26,075
I think that's also part of what I have to deal with.

739
00:27:26,076 --> 00:27:27,876
You should get through it if you're a man.

740
00:27:29,376 --> 00:27:30,745
You should.

741
00:27:30,746 --> 00:27:32,106
(That's right.)

742
00:27:32,176 --> 00:27:33,276
What about you two?

743
00:27:33,846 --> 00:27:34,976
How is it?

744
00:27:36,416 --> 00:27:37,786
My dad supports us.

745
00:27:38,686 --> 00:27:40,756
He supports us.

746
00:27:42,016 --> 00:27:43,356
I think it's a relief.

747
00:27:44,586 --> 00:27:46,555
I didn't tell them until the end.

748
00:27:46,556 --> 00:27:49,266
I didn't tell my parents who the final couple was.

749
00:27:49,426 --> 00:27:50,965
Even to your parents?

750
00:27:50,966 --> 00:27:52,765
I didn't tell them,

751
00:27:52,766 --> 00:27:54,436
so every Wednesday, my parents would say,

752
00:27:54,766 --> 00:27:56,235
"Will it be Jin Young or Ji Hye?"

753
00:27:56,236 --> 00:27:57,966
They said they were excited.

754
00:27:58,936 --> 00:28:00,775
(It's me, Mother.)

755
00:28:00,776 --> 00:28:02,006
They were like that.

756
00:28:02,946 --> 00:28:05,815
I actually told my mom...

757
00:28:05,816 --> 00:28:07,675
who the real couples were.

758
00:28:07,676 --> 00:28:09,285
She watched the show and suddenly said,

759
00:28:09,286 --> 00:28:13,056
"Didn't you say Jeong Won was with Ji Hye?"

760
00:28:14,786 --> 00:28:16,886
Even Jeong Won's parents are confused.

761
00:28:18,186 --> 00:28:19,726
My mom is confused.

762
00:28:20,356 --> 00:28:21,996
She called him.

763
00:28:22,226 --> 00:28:23,826
She kept calling me during the show.

764
00:28:24,326 --> 00:28:25,796
Did she say, "Who did you end up with?"

765
00:28:26,066 --> 00:28:27,496
"What are you doing?"

766
00:28:29,306 --> 00:28:30,306
Seriously.

767
00:28:30,307 --> 00:28:32,036
What about you? Did you tell your parents?

768
00:28:32,366 --> 00:28:35,705
Jin Wu met my mom.

769
00:28:35,706 --> 00:28:36,745
(Exclaiming)

770
00:28:36,746 --> 00:28:37,846
- Already?
- Yes.

771
00:28:37,976 --> 00:28:40,515
The hospital... My parents are in Cheongju.

772
00:28:40,516 --> 00:28:42,015
Jin Wu came to Cheongju,

773
00:28:42,016 --> 00:28:44,846
and we happened to run into each other.

774
00:28:45,216 --> 00:28:48,886
So we talked.

775
00:28:49,626 --> 00:28:52,085
Mom really likes Jin Wu.

776
00:28:52,086 --> 00:28:53,195
Really?

777
00:28:53,196 --> 00:28:55,395
- He's so polite.
- Right.

778
00:28:55,396 --> 00:28:57,196
She really likes him.

779
00:28:57,626 --> 00:29:00,896
My parents are like Jeong Won's parents.

780
00:29:01,036 --> 00:29:02,365
Before she came,

781
00:29:02,366 --> 00:29:03,836
there were four women.

782
00:29:04,066 --> 00:29:06,875
"There's no one called Jin Young among the four."

783
00:29:06,876 --> 00:29:08,135
"Who is she?"

784
00:29:08,136 --> 00:29:09,905
So I didn't tell her yet.

785
00:29:09,906 --> 00:29:11,405
She got to know after she appeared.

786
00:29:11,406 --> 00:29:12,475
I see.

787
00:29:12,476 --> 00:29:14,016
My parents like her...

788
00:29:15,346 --> 00:29:16,446
because she's pretty.

789
00:29:17,986 --> 00:29:20,155
Seriously. This is so annoying.

790
00:29:20,156 --> 00:29:21,186
Right.

791
00:29:21,656 --> 00:29:22,686
Yes.

792
00:29:28,026 --> 00:29:31,426
While watching the show, I was a little...

793
00:29:32,636 --> 00:29:34,265
- worried...
- Right.

794
00:29:34,266 --> 00:29:35,695
about these two couples.

795
00:29:35,696 --> 00:29:36,865
At first,

796
00:29:36,866 --> 00:29:38,636
- So...
- you were matched differently.

797
00:29:40,676 --> 00:29:42,946
(Shaking her head)

798
00:29:43,446 --> 00:29:45,875
(Goodness)

799
00:29:45,876 --> 00:29:48,175
We both didn't know...

800
00:29:48,176 --> 00:29:49,485
how each other's date went.

801
00:29:49,486 --> 00:29:51,646
