I felt really bad for him.

1322
00:48:43,265 --> 00:48:45,024
Although this is a show...

1323
00:48:45,025 --> 00:48:48,265
to get to know others and develop feelings for someone,

1324
00:48:48,835 --> 00:48:52,534
you don't have to force yourself to get to know someone...

1325
00:48:52,535 --> 00:48:53,904
or develop feelings for them...

1326
00:48:53,905 --> 00:48:56,904
when you don't have someone...

1327
00:48:56,905 --> 00:48:58,274
like that.

1328
00:48:58,275 --> 00:49:00,414
That's also for the sake of your date partner.

1329
00:49:00,415 --> 00:49:03,014
Wouldn't it be better to think,

1330
00:49:03,015 --> 00:49:06,355
"Let's just have some fun with whomever it is?"

1331
00:49:06,755 --> 00:49:08,884
That was... How do I put it?

1332
00:49:08,885 --> 00:49:10,625
It was a series of coincidences.

1333
00:49:10,855 --> 00:49:13,724
After being rejected by Ji Hye,

1334
00:49:13,725 --> 00:49:14,955
I was alone in the room.

1335
00:49:15,495 --> 00:49:17,525
I wanted to talk to someone, no matter who it was.

1336
00:49:17,565 --> 00:49:20,034
Just when I opened the door and stepped outside...

1337
00:49:20,035 --> 00:49:21,734
That was the first time...

1338
00:49:21,735 --> 00:49:24,804
I had an adult-like serious talk with Jin Young...

1339
00:49:24,805 --> 00:49:25,805
in those five days.

1340
00:49:26,275 --> 00:49:29,205
She was very different from the person I imagined.

1341
00:49:29,775 --> 00:49:31,474
That was the reason...

1342
00:49:31,475 --> 00:49:32,915
my feelings grew.

1343
00:49:33,215 --> 00:49:35,644
Jin Young was there...

1344
00:49:35,645 --> 00:49:36,715
like fate.

1345
00:49:37,145 --> 00:49:39,014
One thing led to another,

1346
00:49:39,015 --> 00:49:41,415
and I went on a date with her the next day.

1347
00:49:41,715 --> 00:49:42,885
That's fate.

1348
00:49:43,485 --> 00:49:44,625
Interesting, isn't it?

1349
00:49:45,885 --> 00:49:47,224
Tell me.

1350
00:49:47,225 --> 00:49:48,455
What did you two talk about?

1351
00:49:48,995 --> 00:49:50,925
- With Jeong Won?
- Yes. Tell me.

1352
00:49:51,665 --> 00:49:54,434
Up until last night, he gave me a clear indication...

1353
00:49:54,435 --> 00:49:55,765
of his feelings.

1354
00:49:55,895 --> 00:49:58,464
But after the date,

1355
00:49:58,465 --> 00:50:01,774
the two came back as if they were already a couple.

1356
00:50:01,775 --> 00:50:02,775
Right.

1357
00:50:03,145 --> 00:50:04,174
(Jin Wu moved next to the upset Jin Young.)

1358
00:50:04,175 --> 00:50:05,305
It could happen.

1359
00:50:05,805 --> 00:50:06,945
Right.

1360
00:50:08,775 --> 00:50:11,084
(Jin Young ended up crying in front of Jin Wu.)

1361
00:50:11,085 --> 00:50:13,155
The two cheered each other up a lot.

1362
00:50:13,885 --> 00:50:17,025
I want you to stop wasting your emotional energy on such things.

1363
00:50:17,125 --> 00:50:19,254
Why do you like someone who makes you cry?

1364
00:50:19,255 --> 00:50:20,825
"Like someone who makes you cry?"

1365
00:50:21,855 --> 00:50:24,365
- My bad.
- The shock...

1366
00:50:24,965 --> 00:50:27,095
has caused a mental breakdown.

1367
00:50:27,135 --> 00:50:28,864
- Is that so?
- I don't blame her for that.

1368
00:50:28,865 --> 00:50:30,065
Exactly.

1369
00:50:30,435 --> 00:50:32,734
Just use me as your emotional dumping ground.

1370
00:50:32,735 --> 00:50:34,605
Or go on a date with me to show off to him.

1371
00:50:35,505 --> 00:50:37,244
You don't have to see me ever again.

1372
00:50:37,245 --> 00:50:39,105
Just go on a date with me tomorrow. Please.

1373
00:50:39,775 --> 00:50:42,145
I want to take care of you, okay?

1374
00:50:44,485 --> 00:50:48,315
I don't want to give you false hope.

1375
00:50:48,415 --> 00:50:50,824
True. You're giving me false hope a lot of times.

1376
00:50:50,825 --> 00:50:54,454
Right? But I feel better after talking with you.

1377
00:50:54,455 --> 00:50:56,364
Talking makes you feel better.

1378
00:50:56,365 --> 00:50:58,625
- Totally.
- So don't cry, Jin Young.

1379
00:50:59,065 --> 00:51:04,535
(Jin Young feels better thanks to Jin Wu.)

1380
00:51:04,735 --> 00:51:07,574
I also agree with the fate part.

1381
00:51:07,575 --> 00:51:09,504
After being rejected by Jeong Won,

1382
00:51:09,505 --> 00:51:13,174
I was going through a total mental breakdown.

1383
00:51:13,175 --> 00:51:15,275
I didn't think I could handle it...

1384
00:51:15,945 --> 00:51:17,814
if I didn't talk about it to someone.

1385
00:51:17,815 --> 00:51:20,515
At that moment, Jin Wu was there.

1386
00:51:20,855 --> 00:51:22,154
Are you crying, Jin Young?

1387
00:51:22,155 --> 00:51:23,755
- It's making me emotional.
- Oh, dear.

1388
00:51:23,855 --> 00:51:25,754
- Don't cry.
- That's what happened.

1389
00:51:25,755 --> 00:51:26,954
(The past emotions make Jin Young tear up.)

1390
00:51:26,955 --> 00:51:28,095
It's okay.

1391
00:51:28,995 --> 00:51:30,265
Don't cry.

1392
00:51:35,695 --> 00:51:37,164
- It's okay.
- That's what happened.

1393
00:51:37,165 --> 00:51:38,905
You're fine now.

1394
00:51:41,135 --> 00:51:45,905
It's not that Jeong Won and Ji Hye did anything wrong.

1395
00:51:46,145 --> 00:51:47,414
I'm grateful.

1396
00:51:47,415 --> 00:51:50,214
In a way, that was what connected us,

1397
00:51:50,215 --> 00:51:52,614
and we're now a happy couple.

1398
00:51:52,615 --> 00:51:54,415
So are you two.

1399
00:51:54,885 --> 00:51:56,284
It's a happy ending.

1400
00:51:56,285 --> 00:51:57,684
- Right?
- That's what I think.

1401
00:51:57,685 --> 00:52:00,194
After watching that, I'm really grateful to Jin Wu.

1402
00:52:00,195 --> 00:52:01,395
I'd be too.

1403
00:52:01,595 --> 00:52:05,065
I'd be too. Watching you two made me teary as well.

1404
00:52:05,465 --> 00:52:06,765
- Right?
- It made me teary as well.

1405
00:52:11,965 --> 00:52:16,545
(Will Jin Young keep the promise from 7 days ago?)

1406
00:52:16,605 --> 00:52:18,304
I can't help but root for Jin Wu.

1407
00:52:18,305 --> 00:52:19,745
Right?

1408
00:52:22,145 --> 00:52:23,715
I've become a fan of Jin Wu.

1409
00:52:25,885 --> 00:52:28,554
- Jin Wu got teary at that moment.
- Hey.

1410
00:52:28,555 --> 00:52:29,755
I saw it.

1411
00:52:30,385 --> 00:52:32,255
(Smiling brightly)

1412
00:52:32,655 --> 00:52:34,255
It's like a love story.

1413
00:52:36,195 --> 00:52:38,124
(Jin Young rushes over to Jin Wu.)

1414
00:52:38,125 --> 00:52:39,325
Hey.

1415
00:52:39,695 --> 00:52:42,434
Were you waiting for me? Look at me. Are you crying?

1416
00:52:42,435 --> 00:52:43,435
(Shaking his head)

1417
00:52:45,705 --> 00:52:47,005
Were you waiting for me?

1418
00:52:48,405 --> 00:52:50,405
- Are you crying?
- No.

1419
00:52:50,645 --> 00:52:52,745
- You're not crying, are you?
- I'm not.

1420
00:52:53,115 --> 00:52:54,275
You look even better now.

1421
00:52:55,445 --> 00:52:56,715
You look handsome today.

1422
00:52:57,315 --> 00:52:58,785
What took you so long?

1423
00:52:59,485 --> 00:53:00,685
Were you waiting for a while?

1424
00:53:01,685 --> 00:53:03,485
(Sighing)

1425
00:53:03,555 --> 00:53:05,384
(They can't help but smile.)

1426
00:53:05,385 --> 00:53:07,055
Why am I smiling like I'm their mom?

1427
00:53:07,395 --> 00:53:09,455
- Me too.
- What's wrong with me?

1428
00:53:10,425 --> 00:53:12,024
It feels like I wasn't part of the show.

1429
00:53:12,025 --> 00:53:14,295
It's like I'm just watching it as an audience member.

1430
00:53:14,765 --> 00:53:17,605
Me too. I just feel like an audience member.

1431
00:53:19,405 --> 00:53:20,775
Jin Wu, I hope you're happy.

1432
00:53:21,205 --> 00:53:22,404
Thank you.

1433
00:53:22,405 --> 00:53:24,204
- I hope you're happy.
- Thanks to everyone's support.

1434
00:53:24,205 --> 00:53:26,875
(Thank you. I am, thanks to everyone's support.)

1435
00:53:27,045 --> 00:53:30,084
Why are you shaking so much?

1436
00:53:30,085 --> 00:53:31,185
Gosh.

1437
00:53:32,885 --> 00:53:33,985
Gosh.

1438
00:53:34,755 --> 00:53:36,424
He said he thought I wouldn't show up.

1439
00:53:36,425 --> 00:53:37,754
- He thought I wouldn't come.
- Really?

1440
00:53:37,755 --> 00:53:38,985
Can you hold my hand?

1441
00:53:39,125 --> 00:53:40,424
You look so pretty today.

1442
00:53:40,425 --> 00:53:41,795
- What? Do I look pretty today?
- You look pretty.

1443
00:53:42,255 --> 00:53:43,525
- I look pretty today?
- You do.

1444
00:53:45,265 --> 00:53:47,865
There was a lot I wanted to say to you.

1445
00:53:48,095 --> 00:53:49,364
(Smiling)

1446
00:53:49,365 --> 00:53:51,265
You've really thought this through over the past week.

1447
00:53:52,235 --> 00:53:53,535
Yes, you were all I could think about.

1448
00:53:54,635 --> 00:53:57,475
Really? To be honest,

1449
00:53:57,805 --> 00:53:59,375
I actually...

1450
00:54:00,875 --> 00:54:04,615
As I thought about it, I realized I felt comfortable with you.

1451
00:54:05,415 --> 00:54:07,515
Right.

1452
00:54:08,085 --> 00:54:10,685
And I appreciated how you took care of me.

1453
00:54:11,885 --> 00:54:14,155
I think I was moved by your consistency...

1454
00:54:14,455 --> 00:54:18,164
and how you always took care of me.

1455
00:54:18,165 --> 00:54:19,695
(They are what I like about you.)

1456
00:54:19,835 --> 00:54:21,864
- Is this really okay?
- You have to...

1457
00:54:21,865 --> 00:54:22,894
- Is this really okay?
- Give her a peck.

1458
00:54:22,895 --> 00:54:24,564
You look so good. Give her a peck on the cheek.

1459
00:54:24,565 --> 00:54:25,905
- Goodness.
- Goodness.

1460
00:54:27,105 --> 00:54:28,234
- Goodness.
- Gosh.

1461
00:54:28,235 --> 00:54:29,905
Your facial expression is different from last time.

1462
00:54:30,805 --> 00:54:32,574
- You have to marry me now.
- Gosh, I'm doomed.

1463
00:54:32,575 --> 00:54:33,815
You have no choice but to marry me now.

1464
00:54:34,775 --> 00:54:36,114
(An older woman and younger man couple with a 1-year age gap)

1465
00:54:36,115 --> 00:54:37,544
(Jin Wu and Jin Young are a couple.)

1466
00:54:37,545 --> 00:54:39,685
Those are so pretty.

1467
00:54:40,255 --> 00:54:43,355
After you officially became a couple, have your feelings...

1468
00:54:43,625 --> 00:54:45,685
or Jin Wu's actions changed in any way?

1469
00:54:46,525 --> 00:54:49,055
Jin Wu has gotten more affectionate.

1470
00:54:49,195 --> 00:54:51,165
He's very affectionate now.

1471
00:54:51,295 --> 00:54:53,635
He writes me a lot of letters.

1472
00:54:54,265 --> 00:54:55,595
Really?

1473
00:54:55,795 --> 00:54:57,165
- He handwrites them?
- He handwrites them?

1474
00:54:57,365 --> 00:54:59,204
Yes, a lot of them are handwritten,

1475
00:54:59,205 --> 00:55:00,775
- and he texts me long messages too.
- Gosh.

1476
00:55:01,135 --> 00:55:02,505
- He texts you long messages?
- Yes.

1477
00:55:02,605 --> 00:55:03,904
(That's amazing.)

1478
00:55:03,905 --> 00:55:05,374
Jin Wu actually went on a trip to Japan...

1479
00:55:05,375 --> 00:55:07,414
not long after we became a couple.

1480
00:55:07,415 --> 00:55:09,814
He wrote me 5 letters so I could read 1 each day...

1481
00:55:09,815 --> 00:55:11,784
while he was gone for those five days.

1482
00:55:11,785 --> 00:55:13,755
From Monday to Saturday.

1483
00:55:13,985 --> 00:55:16,055
That way, I had one to read every day.

1484
00:55:16,085 --> 00:55:17,085
(That's amazing.)

1485
00:55:17,086 --> 00:55:18,225
Really?

1486
00:55:19,225 --> 00:55:22,024
(Jin Wu doesn't hold back when it comes to expressing his love.)

1487
00:55:22,025 --> 00:55:24,025
- That's amazing.
- How do you feel about that?

1488
00:55:24,125 --> 00:55:25,195
Really?

1489
00:55:25,325 --> 00:55:26,535
I'm not really into that.

1490
00:55:28,735 --> 00:55:30,734
(Ji Hye and Jin Wu are complete opposites.)

1491
00:55:30,735 --> 00:55:32,234
It's good we didn't end up together.

1492
00:55:32,235 --> 00:55:33,404
It's good we didn't end up together.

1493
00:55:33,405 --> 00:55:35,775
- Yes, you each found your person.
- Right.

1494
00:55:37,505 --> 00:55:39,374
I can't really read things like that.

1495
00:55:39,375 --> 00:55:40,874
(They're too cringey for me to read.)

1496
00:55:40,875 --> 00:55:42,314
You don't click "Read more" when a text is really long, right?

1497
00:55:42,315 --> 00:55:45,084
The words "View all" make me feel like I'm suffocating.

1498
00:55:45,085 --> 00:55:47,115
It's exhausting.

1499
00:55:47,815 --> 00:55:48,855
Gosh, I can't.

1500
00:55:49,485 --> 00:55:50,584
"Read more."

1501
00:55:50,585 --> 00:55:51,954
(That's understandable.)

1502
00:55:51,955 --> 00:55:53,025
It all worked out well.

1503
00:55:53,925 --> 00:55:57,064
That's why we don't text each other.

1504
00:55:57,065 --> 00:55:58,364
We video call instead.

1505
00:55:58,365 --> 00:55:59,624
We only talk over video calls.

1506
00:55:59,625 --> 00:56:01,564
Your KakaoTalk chat is probably just full of video call records.

1507
00:56:01,565 --> 00:56:02,965
Right, with no messages at all.

1508
00:56:03,405 --> 00:56:06,675
We only text each other about important things.

1509
00:56:06,935 --> 00:56:08,435
You two are a good match.

1510
00:56:09,105 --> 00:56:11,074
- Yes, everyone has their person.
- That's right.

1511
00:56:11,075 --> 00:56:12,645
(The older women and younger men each found their match.)

1512
00:56:13,175 --> 00:56:15,245
- It's our turn, Si Won.
- What?

1513
00:56:15,515 --> 00:56:17,215
- Gosh, this is going to be fun.
- Gosh.

1514
00:56:17,376 --> 00:56:19,306
- It's our turn, Si Won.
- What?

1515
00:56:19,476 --> 00:56:21,016
- Gosh, this is going to be fun.
- Gosh.

1516
00:56:21,576 --> 00:56:25,585
(Yu Jin and Si Won, the couple with a 12-year age gap)

1517
00:56:25,586 --> 00:56:27,515
- What number were you?
- My number?

1518
00:56:27,516 --> 00:56:31,855
In baseball, jersey numbers don't really matter,

1519
00:56:31,856 --> 00:56:33,295
but the player's position is related to the jersey number...

1520
00:56:33,296 --> 00:56:35,055
- in soccer.
- Yes, they're all different.

1521
00:56:35,056 --> 00:56:37,465
- The goalkeeper is number 1.
- Number 1.

1522
00:56:37,466 --> 00:56:40,366
And is the midfielder number 7?

1523
00:56:40,496 --> 00:56:42,605
- Is that right?
- Yes, but wingers get seven too.

1524
00:56:42,606 --> 00:56:44,035
- The wingers.
- You clicked so well that...

1525
00:56:44,036 --> 00:56:45,576
- you must have been attracted.
- Yes.

1526
00:56:46,106 --> 00:56:48,076
- I think that's when it started.
- Yes.

1527
00:56:48,776 --> 00:56:50,376
The waves are too rough.

1528
00:56:50,606 --> 00:56:53,746
(After playing in the water, the men gather around the women.)

1529
00:56:54,416 --> 00:56:56,016
Can't we do something about the waves?

1530
00:56:56,346 --> 00:56:57,586
I wonder if they can turn off the waves.

1531
00:56:57,986 --> 00:57:00,716
(Just then, Yu Jin got water on her face.)

1532
00:57:01,056 --> 00:57:02,056
(Watching carefully)

1533
00:57:02,057 --> 00:57:03,725
Right.

1534
00:57:03,726 --> 00:57:06,525
(Moving to sit in front of her)

1535
00:57:06,526 --> 00:57:08,795
- Sit.
- I'll act as your breakwater.

1536
00:57:08,796 --> 00:57:10,526
He's like a breakwater.

1537
00:57:11,396 --> 00:57:14,266
(Si Won shielded Yu Jin from the waves.)

1538
00:57:14,496 --> 00:57:17,205
- You shielded me from the waves.
- Yes.

1539
00:57:17,206 --> 00:57:18,466
I only found out about it when I watched the show.

1540
00:57:19,706 --> 00:57:23,306
(He expresses himself through actions rather than words.)

1541
00:57:23,376 --> 00:57:25,915
(Dinner time at Yeon House)

1542
00:57:25,916 --> 00:57:27,115
It's so...

1543
00:57:27,116 --> 00:57:29,245
- You should eat a lot and recharge.
- Yes.

1544
00:57:29,246 --> 00:57:30,945
- Right?
- But nothing sounds good.

1545
00:57:30,946 --> 00:57:31,946
Really?

1546
00:57:31,947 --> 00:57:33,516
If neither pizza nor chicken sounds good,

1547
00:57:35,926 --> 00:57:37,226
what should you eat?

1548
00:57:37,456 --> 00:57:38,656
- Porridge?
- Porridge.

1549
00:57:39,626 --> 00:57:41,556
I can use some instant rice to make porridge.

1550
00:57:42,966 --> 00:57:44,026
No, it's fine.

1551
00:57:44,696 --> 00:57:47,396
- I was really grateful at the time.
- It's...

1552
00:57:47,736 --> 00:57:49,266
The way you were by my side and...

1553
00:57:49,406 --> 00:57:50,466
I'll do it.

1554
00:57:51,436 --> 00:57:53,775
- You didn't look good at all.
- I was so sick.

1555
00:57:53,776 --> 00:57:55,136
I was so sick at the time.

1556
00:57:56,146 --> 00:57:59,775
(Si Won stayed by Yu Jin's side and took care of her.)

1557
00:57:59,776 --> 00:58:02,175
- Si Won is so caring.
- He is.

1558
00:58:02,176 --> 00:58:04,616
He takes good care of you in his own subtle way.

1559
00:58:04,846 --> 00:58:07,215
His affection is understated, unlike Jin Wu.

1560
00:58:07,216 --> 00:58:08,256
That's right.

1561
00:58:08,886 --> 00:58:10,226
Is Jin Wu's affection a little too cheesy for you?

1562
00:58:11,556 --> 00:58:13,955
No, Jin Wu is great.

1563
00:58:13,956 --> 00:58:16,026
Jin Wu is just really sweet.

1564
00:58:16,226 --> 00:58:19,066
His sweetness is a little cheesy?

1565
00:58:19,366 --> 00:58:22,336
(They're both caring, but in different ways.)

1566
00:58:22,436 --> 00:58:25,705
(It's time for the age reveal.)

1567
00:58:25,706 --> 00:58:26,876
- Si Won.
- It's Si Won.

1568
00:58:26,976 --> 00:58:28,175
Si Won is definitely young.

1569
00:58:28,176 --> 00:58:29,405
- Si Won is definitely young.
- Right.

1570
00:58:29,406 --> 00:58:30,876
- I think he's the youngest.
- I'm going to say 1999.

